{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-touch-model","title":"多触点归因模型选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-user-growth-attribution/attribution-model/multi-touch-model","wordCount":2244,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"多触点归因模型选择\">多触点归因模型选择</h1><p>一个用户在被首次转化之前接触了七个触点：TikTok 视频、Google 品牌词、一封邮件、一个比价网站、再营销横幅、KOL 的视频、以及最后那次直接访问。这七个触点分属四个渠道、三个部门、两个预算科目。归因模型就是决定这七个触点各分到多少功劳的那部规则。这篇文章给出各模型的机制、代价、以及&quot;该选哪个&quot;的可操作判据，并在最后指出这套方法的共同上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-所有模型都在回答同一个方程\">核心概念：所有模型都在回答同一个方程</h2><p>归因的数学形式极其简单：把一次转化记为一个总价值，按一组权重分给路径上的各个触点。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>credit</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{credit}(c_j) = V \\sum_{p \\in P} w_j(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">credit</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是转化的价值（可以是 1 次转化、也可以是金额），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是所有转化路径的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是触点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 中的权重，且对任意路径有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j w_j(p) = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。所有规则型模型的区别，只在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 这个函数怎么定义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[触点序列] --&gt; B{规则型}&#10;    A --&gt; C{数据驱动型}&#10;    B --&gt; B1[首触 first-touch]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[末触 last-touch]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[线性 linear]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[时间衰减 time-decay]&#10;    B --&gt; B5[位置 40/20/40]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Shapley 值]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[马尔可夫链移除效应]&#10;    B1 --&gt; D[可解释、可复现&lt;br/&gt;无数据依赖]&#10;    B2 --&gt; D&#10;    B3 --&gt; D&#10;    B4 --&gt; D&#10;    B5 --&gt; D&#10;    C1 --&gt; E[反映组合贡献&lt;br/&gt;成本高、可被噪声主导]&#10;    C2 --&gt; E\">graph TD\n    A[触点序列] --&gt; B{规则型}\n    A --&gt; C{数据驱动型}\n    B --&gt; B1[首触 first-touch]\n    B --&gt; B2[末触 last-touch]\n    B --&gt; B3[线性 linear]\n    B --&gt; B4[时间衰减 time-decay]\n    B --&gt; B5[位置 40/20/40]\n    C --&gt; C1[Shapley 值]\n    C --&gt; C2[马尔可夫链移除效应]\n    B1 --&gt; D[可解释、可复现&lt;br/&gt;无数据依赖]\n    B2 --&gt; D\n    B3 --&gt; D\n    B4 --&gt; D\n    B5 --&gt; D\n    C1 --&gt; E[反映组合贡献&lt;br/&gt;成本高、可被噪声主导]\n    C2 --&gt; E</pre><p>规则的复杂度与解释成本大致成正比。团队规模小、渠道少时，末触或首触就够用；渠道数超过十个、预算量级大时，规则型模型的偏袒会被放大到影响决策，这时才值得引入数据驱动模型。<strong>不要为了&quot;先进&quot;而选复杂模型——模型越复杂，你越难向业务方解释为什么某个渠道的数字变了。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"规则型模型逐一对比\">规则型模型逐一对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>权重规则</th>\n<th>偏向</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>主要弊端</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首触</td>\n<td>只给路径第一个触点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>顶端渠道（品牌、内容）</td>\n<td>评估新客获取、品牌投放</td>\n<td>完全忽略临门一脚的渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末触</td>\n<td>只给最后一个触点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>底端渠道（品牌词、再营销）</td>\n<td>短决策周期、效果广告优化</td>\n<td>系统性高估拦截型渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>所有触点均分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>触点少、路径短</td>\n<td>把无关的早期浏览与关键触点等价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间衰减</td>\n<td>越接近转化权重越高，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w \\propto 2^{-t/\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>底端</td>\n<td>决策周期长的品类</td>\n<td>半衰期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是又一个拍脑袋参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置 40/20/40</td>\n<td>首尾各 40%，中间均分 20%</td>\n<td>顶+底</td>\n<td>兼顾拉新与转化</td>\n<td>中间触点的价值被结构性低估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时间衰减的半衰期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 值得展开一句：它与归因窗口是两个不同的参数，但经常被混淆。窗口决定&quot;哪些触点有资格参与分配&quot;，半衰期决定&quot;有资格的触点之间怎么分&quot;。把窗口设 30 天、半衰期设 7 天，意味着第 25 天的一次点击权重会非常低——这种组合在实践中往往是错的，需要按品类决策周期实测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据驱动模型-shapley-与马尔可夫链\">数据驱动模型：Shapley 与马尔可夫链</h2><p><strong>Shapley 值</strong>来自合作博弈论，思想是公平地衡量每个参与者的边际贡献：对每一种可能的参与者子集，计算加入该成员前后的价值增量，再对所有子集求平均。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_j = \\sum_{S \\subseteq N \\setminus \\{j\\}} \\frac{|S|!\\,(n-|S|-1)!}{n!}\\bigl(v(S \\cup \\{j\\}) - v(S)\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.943em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在归因场景里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是全部渠道集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;当只有渠道集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 在场时能拿到的转化数&quot;。它的优点是<strong>能捕捉渠道组合的协同效应</strong>——两个渠道一起投效果好、单独投都差的组合，Shapley 会给它们都高分。实践中几乎不用精确计算（渠道数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 稍大就是指数级），而是用只含&quot;出现过一次或两次触点的路径&quot;的简化变体来近似，这也是行业里常见实现的通行做法。</p>\n<p><strong>马尔可夫链移除效应</strong>把用户路径建成一个吸收马尔可夫链：节点是渠道、起点与转化/流失两个吸收态，边是转移概率。然后用&quot;移除某渠道后总转化率下降多少&quot;来衡量它的价值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>removal_effect</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>convert</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>convert</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>convert</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{removal\\_effect}(c_j) = \\frac{P(\\text{convert}) - P_{-j}(\\text{convert})}{P(\\text{convert})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">removal_effect</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">convert</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">convert</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">convert</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个视角比 Shapley 更直观（&quot;拿掉它，转化会掉多少&quot;），且天然处理&quot;渠道在路径不同位置出现&quot;的情形。它的代价是忽略时间维度与触点次数，且当渠道之间高度相关时，移除效应会被低估。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Shapley</th>\n<th>马尔可夫移除</th>\n<th>规则型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>高（需近似）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解释难度</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（&quot;拿掉会掉多少&quot;）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理协同效应</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据量要求</td>\n<td>高（路径数需足够）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受噪声影响</td>\n<td>高（小样本下不稳定）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选择判据可以归结为三条</strong>：路径数够不够（路径数少于几万的样本，数据驱动模型的分值会被噪声主导，不值得用）、渠道间是否存在真实的组合效应、以及团队能否向业务方解释结论。三条里任何一条不满足，就退回规则型模型，并用多种模型做敏感性分析而不是选一个&quot;正确答案&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型选择的决策路径\">模型选择的决策路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[开始选择归因模型] --&gt; B{路径样本数 &gt; 5万?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[规则型模型]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{渠道数 &gt; 10 且预算量级大?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| C&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E{能否解释给业务方?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| C&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[数据驱动模型&lt;br/&gt;与规则型并行做敏感性分析]&#10;    C --&gt; G[选定 1 主模型 + 2 对照模型]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[按同一口径落到 CAC 计算]\">flowchart TD\n    A[开始选择归因模型] --&gt; B{路径样本数 &gt; 5万?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[规则型模型]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{渠道数 &gt; 10 且预算量级大?}\n    D --&gt;|否| C\n    D --&gt;|是| E{能否解释给业务方?}\n    E --&gt;|否| C\n    E --&gt;|是| F[数据驱动模型&lt;br/&gt;与规则型并行做敏感性分析]\n    C --&gt; G[选定 1 主模型 + 2 对照模型]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[按同一口径落到 CAC 计算]</pre><p><code>G</code> 这一步是实践中最重要的：<strong>永远不要只跑一个模型</strong>。主模型用于对外汇报与预算分配，两个对照组用于度量&quot;结论对模型的敏感度&quot;。如果某渠道在首触下排第一、在末触下排第五，那么它的真实位置就在中间某个地方，任何把它当第一或第五的决策都是脆弱的。这种敏感性本身就是重要的信息，它告诉你这个渠道的归因结论不可靠到可以据此做大额调整的程度。</p>\n<p>另外要注意模型选择与下游指标的耦合。CAC 的分母直接来自归因结果，因此<strong>换模型等于换了分母</strong>，历史 CAC 序列会断裂。正确做法是模型变更时对历史数据做一次重算并按新口径重述，而不是让新旧口径混在一条时间序列里。这条规则详见<a href=\"../cac-ltv-growth/cac-calculation-channel\">分渠道 CAC 计算口径</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上限-归因衡量相关性-不衡量因果\">上限：归因衡量相关性，不衡量因果</h2><p>必须把这句话放在最醒目的位置：<strong>所有归因模型，无论多复杂，衡量的是触点与转化之间的相关性，不是因果性。</strong></p>\n<p>一个反例足够说明问题。假设某渠道的广告位精准地定向了&quot;本来就要买&quot;的用户——比如品牌词的搜索广告。在数据上，这些用户都会点击这条广告，因此末触模型会把他们的功劳全给它；Shapley 也会给它高分，因为&quot;没有这条广告时转化确实会少&quot;——但这只是因为不投广告时这些用户会走自然搜索，而自然搜索在你的数据里没有被记为一次可归因的触点。<strong>数据驱动模型能处理渠道之间的交互，却不能凭空造出反事实。</strong></p>\n<p>这个上限决定了第 4 章的存在：要得到因果答案，唯一可靠的方法是把一部分人真的排除在投放之外，制造一个可观测的反事实。geo holdout 就是在大规模场景下实现这一点的方法，见 <a href=\"../incremental-growth/geo-holdout-growth\">geo holdout 衡量渠道增量</a>。增量实验的价值正在于它是<strong>给归因口径做校准的参照系</strong>：如果某渠道的归因数远大于它的增量数，说明大部分功劳是被拦下的自然流量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>所有归因模型都是同一个方程的不同权重函数；规则型与数据驱动型的区别只在复杂度与能否处理渠道协同。</li>\n<li>规则型里首触偏顶端、末触偏底端、线性过于均匀、时间衰减引入半衰期参数、位置模型结构性低估中间触点，各自有明确的适用场景。</li>\n<li>Shapley 衡量边际贡献、马尔可夫移除效应衡量&quot;拿掉会掉多少&quot;，两者都要求足够的路径样本量，都受噪声影响。</li>\n<li>选择判据是路径样本数、是否存在组合效应、以及可解释性三条；不满足就用规则型。</li>\n<li>永远并行跑一个主模型加两个对照模型，用敏感性分析判断结论的稳健性，而不是寻找唯一正确的模型。</li>\n<li>归因衡量相关性而非因果性；它的价值校准必须靠增量实验，见第 4 章。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模型选好了，但还有一大类触点根本没有点击可以参与分配——用户只是看到了广告。这类曝光的归因该怎么处理，见<a href=\"view-through-attrib\">展示型广告的浏览归因</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多触点归因模型选择","id":"多触点归因模型选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：所有模型都在回答同一个方程","id":"核心概念-所有模型都在回答同一个方程"},{"level":2,"text":"规则型模型逐一对比","id":"规则型模型逐一对比"},{"level":2,"text":"数据驱动模型：Shapley 与马尔可夫链","id":"数据驱动模型-shapley-与马尔可夫链"},{"level":2,"text":"模型选择的决策路径","id":"模型选择的决策路径"},{"level":2,"text":"上限：归因衡量相关性，不衡量因果","id":"上限-归因衡量相关性-不衡量因果"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自然流量与付费流量区分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-user-growth-attribution/traffic-source-track/organic-paid-separate"},"next":{"title":"展示型广告的浏览归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-user-growth-attribution/attribution-model/view-through-attrib"}}